  "title": "Pumpkin Custard",
  "description": "This creamy pumpkin custard is not too sweet and delicately spiced with cinnamon, nutmeg, and ginger for a smooth, elegant dessert for Thanksgiving.",
  "authors": [
    "Chardonnay Queen"
  ],
